      "cooked": "<p>Hey, everyone!</p><p>Are you in the UK or feel like making a whirlwind trip to Birmingham? If so, we'd love to see you at UK Games Expo this year!</p><p>We are looking for a handful of people to help us out with running demos and being amazing from June 2nd to June 4th. In exchange for a few hours of your time each day, we'll provide a badge for you to enjoy the show with the rest of your time.</p><p>So if you think this sounds fun or you have a friend who would, send me an email to craig@greaterthangames.com.</p>",
